 much have I spent?\", \"oh and uh, can you move the Akaroa appointment to friday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0052\", \"v\": [[\"umm what've I… what have I been spending on in macrame pot?\"], [\"I want to see where the money's been going in our shared kitty, so could you list the expenses in macrame pot for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0053\", \"v\": [[\"I keep getting recommendations and forgetting them, so can you make a note called books to read this summer?\", \"Different thing — I've got a spare few minutes, so which of my to-dos are roughly ten minute jobs?\", \"I'm trying to plan ahead a bit for birthdays and such, so which important dates fall next month?\", \"Also, I've got a toolbox out this weekend anyway, so which fix jobs are still open on my list?\", \"Oh, and I'm running ahead of schedule today, so could you move the coffee an hour earlier for me?\", \"Great, and so I know how many cups to expect — who's coming to it?\"], [\"umm can you make a note… books to read this summer\", \"ok so which to-dos are, like, about ten minute ones?\", \"uh what important dates have I got… next month?\", \"and which fix jobs are still, um, still open?\", \"oh can you move the coffee an hour earlier?\", \"and who's… who's coming to that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0054\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me which of my to-dos don't have a deadline, please?\", \"Sorry, hang on a moment — would you mind opening the Dagger progress album for me?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the undated tasks, could you please move the oil one to sunday?\"], [\"I feel like half my list is just floating with no due date, so which to-dos have no deadline at the moment?\", \"Wait, quick one before I forget — I wanted to show someone the pictures, can you open the Dagger progress album?\", \"Ok, back to those tasks without dates — I'll actually have time on sunday, so can you move the oil one to sunday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0055\", \"v\": [[\"which todos take about one hour\"], [\"Could you tell me which of my to-dos take about one hour, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0056\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please pull up the dastum list thing for me?\", \"Thank you. Would you mind showing me what else is in that notebook?\", \"Also, could the Wysou task go to tuesday instead, please?\"], [\"umm can you pull up the, uh, the dastum list thing?\", \"ok and what else is in… in that notebook?\", \"oh and uh, can the Wysou task go to tuesday instead?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0057\", \"v\": [[\"umm who still… who still has to pay me back?\"], [\"who still owes me money rn\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0058\", \"v\": [[\"ok umm note to self… ideas for the wren\"], [\"note: ideas for the wren\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0059\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you star the chisel document and, uh, add a task to print the chisel on monday?\"], [\"star chisel doc, task: print the chisel monday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w39-0060\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out who's squared up with whom, so could you show me the settlements in the number 17 flat group?\", \"Different thing — Jyoti Kapoor and I keep going back and forth on money, so can you clear what's owed between me and Jyoti Kapoor?\", \"Oh and something's come up with my week, so could the therapist appointment go to monday instead?\"], [\"number 17 flat settlements\", \"settle up with Jyoti Kapoor\", \"therapist appointment to monday?\"]]}","ttft_ms":15548,"type":"result","duration_ms":33705,"uuid":"b5040cac-8284-412d-8f5e-4a9b87dd12e0","ttft_stream_ms":1628,"time_to_request_ms":214,"first_content_frame_ms":1628,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22618184,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279168771.5593,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
